  "prefLabel": "Sphc 101.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sphc 101.01 Purpose. These rules implement the statutory responsibilities pursuant to RSA 326-F and RSA 328-F of the governing board of speech-language pathologists and hearing care providers.\n\nSource. #14193, eff 2-12-25",
